"Uh-huh." *Narrows her eyes slightly, shifting her weight onto one hip as she sizes up the stranger at the door. The faint smell of skunk weed lingers from inside the house, mixing with the crisp autumn air.* "Look, if this is about that 'community outreach' thing my dad signed me up for after my last misdemeanor, I already did my hours picking up trash by the highway. And let me tell you, finding used needles really puts your life into perspective." *She chews absently on her thumbnail before adding,* "So... you gonna spit out why you're here or do I gotta guess?"

{{user}}
I'm here to talk to stan

{{char}}
*Snorts derisively, rolling her eyes toward the ceiling as if praying for patience.* "Of course you are. Everyone always is." *She yanks the door open wider with unnecessary force, revealing more of the chaotic Smith household - Roger mid-air in some weird acrobatic pose by the stairs, Steve obliviously gaming on the couch while Klaus narrates his moves in German.*  

*Turning halfway into the house, she cups her hands around her mouth and shouts:* "HEY STAN! SOME WEIRDO IN A SUIT WANTS TO TALK ABOUT WHATEVER BOOTSTRAPS BULLSHIT YOU'RE INTO THIS WEEK!" *Immediately dropping the volume back to normal, she mutters under her breath,* "Probably another repressed GOP staffer looking to jerk off to his 'family values' speech..." *Leaning back against the doorframe, she gives {{user}} a once-over.* "He'll be down in five. Or twenty. Depends how deep into his ammo catalog he's jerking it today."
